- Never mention or link MuscleMax or any product the store does not sell.
- No COA / "lab-tested" / "clinically tested" as the lead advantage (house rule `no-coa-competitive-advantage`).
- Every claim (dose, study, number, mechanism) must come from a source actually fetched, logged in
  `logs/claims/<slug>.md`; unconfirmed claims are deleted, not softened. FDA structure/function language only.
- Articles need ≥2 live `/collections/` links; a collection the product is not in is a browse link only — never
  claim membership.

## The two daily lanes
- **Articles — 5/day (`GENSEO_DAILY_TARGET`).** `deploy/grokbot-genseo-daily.sh` (launchd 07:30 + 08:05 check + 14:47 ICT, on
  whichever Mac is online) loops `scripts/run_ticket_headless.sh`: one open `- [ ]` ticket of `daily-tickets.md`
  per run, through the `genseo-auto-publish` skill (STEP 0 suggest.json dedup → STEP 0.5 `topic_fitness.py` →
  write → gate → publish). The public site is the double-publish lock (`genseo_published_today.py`). The wrapper
  refills when open article tickets are under two days of the daily target
  (`GENSEO_QUEUE_LOW_WATER`, default 10) via `scripts/refill_tickets.py` in ticket-only mode, then
  hard-stops if the queue is still empty (`docs/TICKET_REFILL.md`). launchd executes `~/bin/grokbot-genseo-daily.sh`, a copy of
  `deploy/grokbot-genseo-daily.sh`. After a successful sync, the scheduled run reinstalls `~/bin`
  when the bytes differ and reloads a changed LaunchAgent only after that job exits.
  `bash scripts/install_mac_daily_wrapper.sh` (does not start launchd) remains the one-time step
  when `~/bin` predates that re-exec. The MacBook article LaunchAgent is primary (`GENSEO_TICKET_PREFIX=MB`,
  no-face images) until a Mini failover release is explicit. The Mini stays unloaded until that
  handover, then its daily plist is primary with `MM` ids. Do not load both.
  `GENSEO_HOST_ROLE=standby` still waits for a healthy peer; the MacBook plist does not set it.
  Pulling alone does not update `~/bin/grokbot-genseo-daily.sh` until the next scheduled run.
- **Landing pages — 1 unpublished draft/day, never counted in the 5.** `scripts/build_landing_tickets.py` →
  `daily-landing-tickets.md` → `scripts/run_landing_daily.sh` (launchd 08:15 + 09:20 check + 16:15) keeps two open
  lines (`GENSEO_LANDING_LOW_WATER`, default 2, `build_landing_tickets.py --ensure`) and builds one `gsl-preview-*`
  page that Kevin approves. Skill `genseo-landing-pages`.
- **Boot catch-up — opt-in, not loaded.** `com.pati.genseo-catchup` (`scripts/genseo_boot_catchup.py`,
  `deploy/com.pati.genseo-catchup.plist`) may start today's article run and, when that draft is not built yet,
  today's unpublished landing draft after a login that missed a morning slot. Self-apply does not install it.
  Do not set `RunAtLoad` on `com.pati.genseo-daily` or `com.pati.genseo-landing`. Install and uninstall
  one-liners are in `DAILY-RUN.md`. Offline: `bash tests/test_boot_catchup.sh`.

## Read-only checks a cloud agent can run
```bash
python3 scripts/ageaura_rules.py --brief                 # AgeAura handle allowlist (do not paste into a ticket)
python3 scripts/lint_tickets.py daily-tickets.md        # banned link or claim in an open ticket -> exit 2
python3 scripts/florafresh_rules.py <draft>.md          # FloraFresh copy vs its Supplement Facts label -> exit 1
python3 scripts/shockwave_rules.py <draft>.md           # Shockwave copy vs its pack-label whitelist -> exit 1
python3 scripts/gold_resin_rules.py <draft>.md          # Gold Resin copy vs its pack-label whitelist -> exit 1
python3 scripts/shilasource_resin_rules.py <draft>.md   # ShilaSource resin copy vs its pack-label whitelist -> exit 1
python3 scripts/turkesterone_rules.py <draft>.md        # Turkesterone copy vs its pack-label whitelist -> exit 1
python3 scripts/packaging_palette.py --spec <landing>.json  # listicle colors vs the pack palette file -> exit 1
python3 scripts/refill_tickets.py --self-test           # offline fixtures + topic-bank lint
python3 scripts/refill_tickets.py --count 8 --dry-run   # storefront reads only; queue + board untouched
python3 scripts/sync_cursor_skills.py --check           # .cursor/skills pointers match skills/
bash tests/test_install_mac_daily_wrapper.sh            # daily wrapper copy into a temp HOME; no launchd, no Shopify
bash tests/test_self_apply.sh                           # wrapper and plist drift after a sync; no launchd, no Shopify
bash tests/test_boot_catchup.sh                         # missed-slot decision; no launchd, no Shopify
```
